      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793637133183,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Keep three envelopes separate\n1. Actions the child may execute or delegate\n2. Sources it may use; model/provider and output audiences\n3. Exact effects already claimed, attempted or still unknown",
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "d-envelopes",
      "originalText": "Keep three envelopes separate\n1. Actions the child may execute or delegate\n2. Sources it may use; model/provider and output audiences\n3. Exact effects already claimed, attempted or still unknown",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "e-2zvsxZceP19phfcf745",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 7231.333587646484,
      "y": 1511.25,
      "width": 847.3328247070312,
      "height": 137.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#26734d",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2p",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 677441802,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1273614730,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793637133183,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Whole-tree execution control\nOne work ID + parent/child lineage + shared capacity + effect intents\nWaiting parents release active compute slots\nCancel/revoke prevents future descendant dispatch, not past remote effects\nRepeated specialist review is allowed; unchanged non-progress is detected",
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "d-work",
      "originalText": "Whole-tree execution control\nOne work ID + parent/child lineage + shared capacity + effect intents\nWaiting parents release active compute slots\nCancel/revoke prevents future descendant dispatch, not past remote effects\nRepeated specialist review is allowed; unchanged non-progress is detected",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "X3t418KzTbTUxASShBN3k",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8773.965438842773,
      "y": 292.5,
      "width": 332.0691223144531,
      "height": 55,
